                            <a href="#"><img src="images/schema-for-business.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="schema-for-business" /></a><br>
                            <div class="cus-bullet">
                                <h3>TABLE OF CONTENT</h3>
                                <li><a href="#1">Need Of Schema In Business</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#2">How Does Schema Work?</a></li>
                                <li><a href="#3">Importance Of Schema In Local Businesses</a></li>
